285 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E (This study examines how in-group and out-group partisan media exposure are associated with hostile media perceptions and the perceived credibility of broadcast network news, and whether these associations vary across levels of uncritical patriotism, drawing on a cross-sectional matched YouGov survey of U.S. adults \(N = 735\).)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [109]
>>
endobj
